Exhibit 1
to
NEw OR TRANSFER LIQUOR LICENSE OR PERMIT APPLICATION
of
Wyoming Horse Racing LLC
All (100%) of the membership interests in Wyoming Horse Racing LLC (“Applicant”) are owned
by WY Funding LLC, a Delaware limited liability company. Applicant is managed by Pacesetter
Racing & Gaming LLC, a Delaware limited liability company (“Manager LLC”). The three
members of Manager LLC are listed on the application. The “No. of Years in Corp or LLC” for
each member is the number of years such indiidual has been a member of Manager LLC. The
application is signed by Mr. Liguori (though each individual is involved in roles relating to the
management of Applicant). Manager LLC is providing management and consulting services to
Applicant
— those services do not include the sale of alcohol.
