RE:
City of Cheyenne Liquor License#3
Transfer from Poor Richards to Wyoming Horse Racing, LLC
Located at6421Speer Road, Cheyenne(Swan Ranch Location)
Dear Mayor Collins:
We are making good progress on the construction for our new Touristic OT B location in the
Swan Ranch development in Cheyenne.As we have discussed, amenities will include a bar and
restaurant to offer guests the opportunity to have a mealand drink while in the facility.To thatend we
have been searching for a liquor license to allow this to happen and havefound one.
We would respectfully request the transferof this license,#3, to our company to complement
the operation of the new Touristic OT B location.We are excited about our new location and look
forward to bringing tourism dollars into Cheyenne from out-of-state visitors.
Wehave completed the necessary application to facilitate this transfer.Please feel free to call
Sincerely,
A
Peter Lig u ori
ExecutiveVP, Wyoming Horse Racing, LLC
Cc: Steven Jimenez, General Manager-Wyoming Horse Racing LLC
